            "subtitle": "Verified Customer",
            "title": "Rotator cuff injury",
            "description": "<p>I underwent lower back surgery in April 2023 and have been struggling ever since with ongoing lower back and lower extremity pain. I’ve dealt with severe muscle spasms and significant arthritis in my lower body, and up until February 2025, nothing seemed to bring real relief. A friend recommended BPC-157 to me, so I decided to give it a try. Within about 30 to 45 days of starting it, I noticed a real difference—my arthritis pain eased up, and my mobility noticeably improved. Just two weeks ago, I was able to ride my snowmobile for the first time in over three and a half years, something I thought I might never do again. Honestly, my back hasn’t felt this good in years, and I feel like I’ve regained the energy and freedom of my late 20s. I am telling everyone about this stuff. Thank you!</p>",
